Z||000000||gtsonly||05-31-2001||12:32 PM||||Now, this is just my opinion! But it seems to me the attraction of the fiero and it's good hearted owners is what makes this site so good. I have pics of my car and I love to see other pics of other Fiero's and what there owners have done to preserve the stigma of the Fiero. But to divide the owners who have pics against owners who may not have that perfect car or just don't have a pic is wrong. From what it sounds, Kerri98 has a wonderful site but it is clouded by a simple URL or lack of. I believe people would still send in pics for the site even if it was public knowledge but the shame comes from the loyal members of Pennocks unable to share. Thats to bad for those members!! As I said, I heard it is a great site, just clouded by a selfish URL....<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||13
Z||000001||FieroLisa||05-31-2001||12:51 PM||||So what if you don't have a "good" pic of your Fiero, or its in restoration or a lack thereof, we still wanna see it! <P>I think Kerri's withholding the URL is fine, cause it *does* make people send in a pic!||||reg||1
Z||000002||84Bill||05-31-2001||12:55 PM||||My 84 pictured on Kerry's page is not exactly a show stopper, faded grease print laidend paint is not pretty to look at, not to mention the left rear roof butress has a gapeing crack all the way across it. The chin spoiler is broken in half and is missing. So I don't think of it as a beauty queen but it is 1 of 4 Fiero's that I'm proud of. And to add even more to my blighted "stigma" they are ALL 2.5 notchbacks the most unwanted Fiero's of all. So. I dont care if people scoff at my car. I just like it and I want other to see it and I happen to have a camera to get a picture of it to share. If someone does not have a digital camera then I'm sure someone they know does, I by no means have gobs of cash to burn but digital cameras are quite cheap now days.<BR>Nothing wrong with Kerry's page just a page with folks and cars on it. <P>Besides, try to join a Fiero club without sending in money and tell me if they send you a news letter. Nothing is free neither is access to Kerry's page||||reg||4
Z||000003||gtsonly||05-31-2001||01:25 PM||||Do get me wrong, I am not mad or will I lose any sleep over it. As I said I have heard nothing but good about the site. I just tend to believe in sharing and helping each other out. Maybe someone out there who does not have a pic of his car but wants to do some fun stuff to it, he could be inspired by what he see's. I just don't see the need to be so private about a pic site. Don't hate me!! Seeing how I am coming to your neck of the woods in a couple of days, lisa!!  I would hate for you dot my eye or something!!!! LOL<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||12
