Z||000016||Jay||05-31-2001||06:53 PM||||Spdfrek, you regestered now you are a member of the group.  That's it!  As for stepping on anyones toes just keep one eye in the back of your head, tempers can flare up from time to time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (right guys?).  The reason Kerri is keeping the site to those who sent in photos is so that she can get the photos. It encourages you to send in a picture, thus making the site bigger and better.  Eventually, we will all have the address. All you gotta do is send in a pic with you and your fiero and you get the address.  No need to spend money on a digital camera or a scanner.  You must have a photo of your car and a friend who has a scanner right?  Well then, what are you waiting for?  Do it...Do it now!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kick.gif">  <BR>THE NORTHSTAR GIVES YOU A REAL KICK IN THE ASS!!!||||reg||1
